  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> must be continuous and differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />For continuity at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />For differentiability at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"> <mrow> <mtable equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr> <mtd> <mrow> <mfrac> <mi>a</mi> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><msqrt> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>;</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mi>b</mi> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>;</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mo>&#8722;</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mrow> <msup> <mn>2</mn> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>b</mi><mi></mi><mi></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
